# The framework commits a Zephyrex RPG Wiki build uses, each from its public GitHub repository.
# Zephyrex RPG Wiki's path dependencies expect the checkouts beside the repository
# (server/pyproject.toml and client/pnpm-workspace.yaml reach them at ../../<name>).
# Bump a ref, and a deploy builds against it. A ref must be on GitHub before a deploy can
# fetch it.
